<PageTitle>Test019 - CascadingParameter vs Inject</PageTitle>

<h1>BLAZMVVM0019: CascadingParameter vs Inject</h1>
<p>Using CascadingParameter for DI service instead of Inject attribute</p>

@code {
    // BLAZMVVM0019: Should use [Inject] for DI services
